WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
<v Ari>Just to confirm, does the booking include the room?</v>

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
<v Blake>Volcanic bananas! I always call a booking an extravaganza.</v>

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
<v Ari>Just to confirm, is the equipment fee a separate charge?</v>

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
<v Blake>Yes, the room is included. The projector costs extra.</v>

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
<v Ari>In practical terms, we need approval before we pay the fee.</v>
